kusisekelo sesihlalo sakho sobukhosi;
ukwethembeka neqiniso kukhamba phambi kwakho.

Somandla, khumbula isiphoqo seenceku zakho
engisethwele ngaphakathi kwami;
khumbula zoke izizwekazi

91:
Wena uqeda abantu,
ekuseni baba njengobuthongo obudlulileko;
babe njengotjani obuphelako:

Siphe amalanga wokujabula,
abe ngangalawo owasibetha ngawo;
iye, njengeminyakeni esabona ngayo okumbi.

92:
Lokha nangibizako ngizamphendula;
ngibe naye eensizini,
ngimhlenge bengimuphe idumo.

93:
kodwana izitha zakho, Somnini,
iye, izitha zakho, qala ziyabhubha;
mbala, iingilamkhuba ziyahlakazwa.

94:
Somnini, isihlalo sakho sobukhosi
sinzinze mandulondulo;
wena ungowanini nanini.

Amanzi amanengi aphakamile, Somnini,
iye, iinkhukhula ziphakamise iphimbo lazo;
mbala, amalwandle aphakamise ukubhodla kwawo.

95:
USomnini uzababuyiselela ngesono sabo,
abathanyele ngobukhohlakali babo;
iye, uSomnini uZimethu uzabathanyela.

97:
Lethani kuSomnini idumo elifanele ibizo lakhe;
lethani iminikelo,
ningene esirhodlweni sethempeli lakhe.

98:
Amafu nobumnyama kumphahlile;
ukulunga nobulungiswa
kusisekelo sesihlalo sakhe sobukhosi.

100:
Phakamisani uSomnini uZimethu;
mlotjheni ebunabelweni beenyawo zakhe.
Mbala, yena ucwengile!

UMosi no-Aroni bebaphakathi kwabaphristi bakhe
noSamyela kilabo ababiza ibizo lakhe.
Nabalilela uSomnini wabezwa;

Somnini, Zimethu, wabaphendula;
waba nguZimu ocolelako kibo,
nanyana wababetha ngezono zabo.

Phakamisani uSomnini uZimethu;
mlotjheni entabenakhe ecwengileko.
Mbala, uSomnini uZimethu ucwengile!

101:
Ngenani emasangwenakhe ngokuthokoza
nesirhodlweni sakhe ngokudumisa;
mthokozeni, nibabaze ibizo lakhe!

102:
Ngikhetha abaqotho enarheni
ukuze bakwazi ukuphila nami;
okhamba endleleni epheleleko
nguye ongangisebenzela;

103:
Ungafihli ubuso bakho kimi
elangeni lesizi lami;
beka indlebakho kimi
mhlana ngikubizako;
ungiphendule masinyana!

Ihliziywami iwohlokile
begodu ibune njengotjani;
sese ngibuthakathaka kobana ngingadla.

104:
okuzalisa ngokuhle,
kufikela lapha waneliseka khona;
ubutjha bakho buvuseleleke njengekhozi.

105:
Wawabekela umkhawulo
lapha angeze afahla khona;
akhange asagubuzesa iphasi godu.

Maye, minengi kangangani imisebenzakho Somnini!
Yoke uyenze ngokuhlakanipha;
iphasi ligcwele umnothwakho.

Kilo kukhamba iinthayamanzi
nonomrhaso welwandle owamdalako;
wamenza bona adlale kilo.

Lokha nawukunikela ukudla, kuyakudobha;
nawuvula isandla sakho
kwaneliswe ngokuhle.

Lokha nawusitheza ubuso, kuyakakamala;
nawususa ummoya wakho lokho, kuyafa,
kubuyele ethulini lapha kubuya khona.

Kwanga iphazimulo yakaSomnini
ingajama isiphelani!
Kwanga uSomnini angathaba emsebenzinakhe;

107:
Somnini, ungikhumbule
lokha nawuba nomusa ebantwini bakho;
ungitjheje nawubasindisako

Kodwana baba masinya
ekukhohlweni imisebenzakhe;
akhange baqalelele iseluleko sakhe.

Wabasindisa kanengi uSomnini,
kodwana bona baba namasu wokuhlubuka;
ngalokho bacwila ngecala labo.

108:
Abanye bazula erhalawumbeni,
ebhudwini bangafunyana indlela eya emzini,
iye, indawo yokuhlala;

Abanye bahlala ebumnyameni,
iye, ethunzini elesabekako;
baziimbotjhwa ezisesizini, emakhamandeleni

wabakhupha ebumnyameni,
iye, ethunzini elesabekako;
wavuthula iimbopho zabo.

Abakhuphulela phezulu,
abuya abaphosa ekuzikeni;
engozini leyo baphakanyelwa ziimbindi,

109:
Zimu, ihliziywami inzinzile;
ngizakuvuma, ngidumise.
Mphefumulwami,

IMowabi isisitja sami sokuhlambela;
phezu kwe-Edomu ngiphosa ipatlagwana lami;
Ngikuhlokomela ngokwenama wena Filistiya!”

110:
Kodwana kwanga lokhu kungaba sibetho
esivela kuSomnini, salabo abangisolako;
iye, salabo abakhuluma okumbi ngepilwami!

Wena Somnini, Somandla,
ngenzela lokho ngebanga lebizo lakho;
iye, ungihlenge ngebanga lokwethembeka kwakho!

Amadolwami ayageba
ngebanga lokuzila ukudla;
umzimbami ukhehlile, ngimathambo.

111:
Izakugweba hlangana nezizwe,
ezizaliswe ngeendumbu;
iye, imadlhe ababusi enarheni ngokunabileko.

112:
Imisebenzi yezandla zakhe
ithembekile begodu ilungile;
yoke ifundiswakhe iliqiniso.

Wathumela abantu bakhe isihlengo;
wayala isivumelwano sakhe isiphelani.
Ibizo lakhe licwengile beliyesabeka!

113:
Iinzukulwana zakhe
zizakuhlonitjhwa enarheni;
iye, abantwana babaqotho bazakubusiswa.

Angeze esaba umbiko omumbi;
ihliziywakhe isekelekile,
iqiniswe kuSomnini;

Wabela ngesihle, aphe abachakileko;
ukulunga kwakhe kujame isiphelani;
idumo lakhe liphakanyiswa ngehlonipho.

116:
Banezandla kodwana azinamizwa;
baneenyawo kodwana azikhambi;
imiphimbabo ayikwazi ukuhomuza.

117:
Ngenganyelwa misinga yokufa,
ivalo lendawo yabafileko langifikela;
ngehlelwa yimbandezelo nesizi.

120:
Susa ihlazo kimi
ngombana liyangilulaza;
imithethwakho iyanganelisa.

Somnini, kwanga ukwethembeka kwakho
kungeza kimi,
iye, isindiswakho ngokwesithembiso sakho;

Ubuqotho bakho
bungebeenzukulwana ngeenzukulwana;
unzinzise iphasi lajama.

Ngisingathe ngokwesithembiso sakho
ukuze ngiphile;
ungavumi ithemba lami lihlaziseke.

Zoke iinkhohlakali zephasi,
uzengula njengegwebu;
ngalokho ngithanda ubufakazi bakho.

Kwanga isibawo sami
singatjhidela kuwe, Somnini;
ungiphe ukuzwisisa ngokwelizwi lakho.

Inga isibawo sami sesirhawu
singafika phambi kwakho;
ungisindise ngokwesithembiso sakho.

121:
Mina ngimumuntu wokuthula;
kodwana nangikhuluma ukuthula,
bona baphehla ipi.

128:
Qala, abantwana
balilifa elivela kuSomnini;
isithelo sesibeletho simvuzo ovela kuye.

133:
wathi: “Le yindawami yokuphumula isiphelani;
lapha, ngizakuhlala khona,
ngombana ngikuthandile.

136:
Nguye okhuphula amafu amhlophe
emikhawulweni yephasi;
wenzela izulu imibani;
nguye ovuthela ummoya eenlulwini zakhe.

139:
Irhubo lakaDavida.
Ngikuthokoza ngehliziywami yoke;
ngikudumise phambi kwabosingazimu.

140:
nobumnyama abuzukuba mnyama kuwe;
ubusuku buzakukhanya njengemini,
iye, ubumnyama bufane nokukhanya.

141:
Ngilonde, Somnini, ezandleni zeenkhohlakali;
ngivikele ebantwini benturhu,
iye, labo abasophe ukungirareja.

Abazigqajako bangifihlele isifu,
bangibekela iinrhobelo zeentambo;
iye, endleleni yoke bangibekela iinthiyo.

142:
Umthandazwami awube njengetjhwalo kuwe;
izandla engiziphakamisileko
zibe njengomnikelo wakusihlwa.

143:
“Ngirhuwelela kuwe Somnini ngithi,
‘Wena usiphephelo sami;
ungikho koke enginakho enarheni yabaphilako.

144:
Nje-ke ngelulela izandla zami kuwe;
umphefumulwami womele wena
njengenarha elibhudu.

145:
Yelula isandla sakho uphezulu;
ngisindise bewungenyule emanzini amanengi,
iye, ezandleni zabatjhili,

Kwanga iinlulu zethu zingaphuphuma
ngemihlobohlobo yemikhiqizo;
izimvu neembuzi zethu zande ngeenkulungwana,
iye, ngeenkulungwana ezilitjhumi
emirhuleni yamadlelwethu;

146:
Abantu bazakumemezela
amandla wokwesabeka kwakho;
nami ngizakufakaza ubukhulu bakho.

bathi: “USomnini unomusa nesirhawu;
ubuthaka ekusilengekeni
nokwethembeka kwakhe kukhulu.

147:
Lokha umphefumulwakhe nawuphumako,
yena ubuyela ehlabathini;
khona mhlokho aphele amaqhingakhe.

owenzela abagandelelweko ubulungiswa
nopha abalambileko ukudla.
USomnini utjhaphulula iimbotjhwa;

USomnini ulonda iinkhonzi,
asekele iintandani nabahlolokazi;
kodwana indlela yeenkhohlakali uyayiphambanisa.

148:
Asikho isizwe akhe enza njalo kiso;
imithethwakhe ayaziwa kiso.
Haleluya!

149:
Koke lokho akudumise ibizo lakaSomnini,
ngombana libizo lakhe lodwa eliphakamileko;
iphazimulwakhe ingehla kwephasi nezulu.

151:
Haleluya!
Dumisani uZimu ethempelini lakhe;
mdumiseni esibangeni samandlakhe.

7:
Nawukhambako, kuzakuhlahla;
nawulalako, kukweluse;
nawuvukako, kukukhulumise.

Mbala umyalo usibani;
ifundiso imukhanyo.
Ukusolwa ngemiyalo kuyindlela yokuphila,

8:
njenje useendledlaneni,
njenje usetatawini ledorobho;
emajikeni woke ucuphile.

12:
Lokha okhohlakeleko nafako,
ithemba lakhe liyatjhabalala;
akulindele emnothwenakhe kuyanyelela.

14:
Umphimbo wevila uyakhaluza,
kodwana awuzuzi;
wabakhutheleko uyaneliswa.

15:
Ukuhlonipha uSomnini
kunikela umuntu isiqiniseko samambala;
lokho kubuphephelo ebantwaneni bakhe.

16:
Ukuyelelisa okuqinileko
kubekelwe otjhiya indlela elungileko;
ozonda ukukhalinywa uzokufa.

Indawo yabafileko nendawo yokubhujiswa
zisemtarini phambi kwakaSomnini;
kangangani-ke imizindlo yomuntu!

Lapha kunganakubonisana khona,
amaqhinga ayatjhabalala;
kodwana ngabeluleki abanengi ayaphumelela.

17:
Isilinganiso namatje wokulinganisa afaneleko
abuya kuSomnini;
iye, woke amatje wokulinganisa angemgodleni ngewakhe.

18:
Isincibilikiseli senzelwa isiliva
nekehla yomlilo ingeyegolide;
umhloli weenhliziyo nguSomnini.

20:
Ukwesaba uSomnini kurholela ekuphileni;
onjalo ulala anelisekile,
angeze athintwa miraro.

Manya isinyefuli,
ukuze onganalwazi abe ngovuthiweko;
sola umuntu onengqondo, uzakuzuza ukuzwisisa.

22:
Umnono ofunyanwa ngelimu elinamanga,
umrhwamuko onyelelako;
abanjalo bazumana nokufa.

Ukwenziwa kobulungiswa
kulethela olungileko itokozo;
kodwana kabaziingilamkhuba kuletha ukubhujiswa.

25:
Ncama ngomsebenzakho wangaphandle,
unake umsebenzi wamasimakho;
ngemva kwalokho, wakhe ikumbakho.

26:
Njengokuqanda kweliqhwa ngesikhathi sokuvuna,
sinjalo-ke nesithunywa esethembekileko kiloyo osithumileko;
siqabula umphefumulo womniniso.

27:
Othumela umlayezo ngesidlhadlha
uzibandakanya enturhwini;
ufana noziqunta iinyawo.

28:
Akube ngomunye okudumisako,
ungazidumisi wena;
iye, kube ngotjhili, kungabi mlomakho.

Amakha netjhwalo kuletha ithabo ehliziyweni,
kunjalo nokuthandeka komngani;
kungokwezeluleko zehliziyo.

29:
Umuntu owurubajwa sisazela sokubulala,
uzakuhlala abalekela ethuneni;
akungabi nomuntu omvimbako.

31:
Dedisa ikohliso namanga kimi;
ungangiphi ubuchaka namkha ubunjinga,
kodwana ngipha kwaphela okwaneleko.

32:
“Akusikho kwamakhosi, Lemuweli;
akusikho kwamakhosi ukurhuqa iwayini,
akusikho kwamakhosana ukomela utjwala.

2:
Okwakhe kwaba khona, kusazakuba khona godu;
nokwakhe kwenziwa kusazakwenziwa godu,
akunalitho elitjha ngaphasi komthunzi welanga.

4:
isikhathi sokulahla amatje
nesikhathi sokuwabuthelela,
isikhathi sokugona nesikhathi sokufulathela;

Koke kuya endaweni yinye;
koke kwavela ethulini,
ngokunjalo koke kuzakubuyela ethulini.

10:
Abaphilako bayazi bonyana bazokuhlongakala,
kodwana abahlongakeleko abazi litho;
abasenamvuzo ngombana ukukhunjulwa kwabo akusekho.

13:
Ekugcineni, koke okuzwakeleko kufanele kunakekelwe:
Yesaba uZimu ulonde imiyalwakhe;
lokho kungokomuntu woke

2:
Iinthako zamakha wakho zinuka kamnandi;
ibizo lakho linjengamakha atsengiweko;
akubabali iintombi zikuthanda kangaka!

5:
Usivande esikhiyelweko dadwabo, makoti;
iye, usivande esikhiyelweko,
umthombo ovaliweko.

6:
Ngizakufika esivandeni sami, dadwabo, makoti;
ngikhe imire yami namakha wami;
ngigome isihlaka sami kanye neliju;
ngisele iwayini lami nebisi.
Gomani bangani,
selani, nidakwe lithando.

8:
umlomakho ube njengewayini eliphambili.
Esithandweni sami iwayini lehla butjhelelezi;
iye, litlelezela eembheneni ezitlerebede.

9:
Akhese ngizwe ilizwi lakho,
wena ohlala eemvandeni;
iye, wena olalelwa bangani bakho!

2:
Ngizokuphendulela isandla sami kuwe, Jerusalema;
ngicwengise amanyelakho kube njengesoda
bengisuse loke ibibi lakho.

3:
Inarhabo igcwele isiliva negolide;
amagugwabo akapheli.
Godu igcwele iinjomani;
iinkarana zabo zepi azipheli.

Inarhabo igcwele abosingazimu;
bakhothamela umsebenzi wezandla zabo,
lokho okwenziwe miminwabo.

Ngaleyondlela abantu bayathotjiswa;
iye, omunye nomunye wabo arhubutjhwe.
Yeke ungabathetheleli Somnini!

Inyazo lomuntu ozikhakhazisako lizakuguqiswa,
nokuziphakamisa kwabantu kuthotjiswe;
nguSomnini kwaphela ozakuphakanyiswa mhlokho.

4:
uSomandla uzokuhluthula iiyaya eenhloko zawo;
iye, uSomnini uzokwenza iimpandla zawo
zibe semtarini.

Esikhundleni seenthako kuzakuba nesivunda;
esikhundleni sekhiba kube mtletlana;
esikhundleni somphotho kube liphandla;
esikhundleni seengungu zethabo kube ziinzilo
nesikhundleni sobuhle kube litshwayo lobukhoboka.

6:
Bazazizwa labo abazidosela isibetho
ngemitja yekohliso
nesono njengomuntu odosa ikoloyana ngentambo;

13:
Mhlokho nizakuthi:
“Bongani uSomnini, nibize ibizo lakhe;
nazise izenzo zakhe phakathi kwezizwe;
nimemezele bona ibizo lakhe liphakamile.

Dumisani uSomnini
ngombana wenze izinto ezibabazekako;
lokhu akwaziwe ephasini loke.

14:
Imisebawo izokubulala amasokana,
akazukuba nezwelo phezu kwesithelo sesibeletho;
amehlwawo akazukurhawukela abantwana.

15:
Leli liqhinga elihloselwe iphasi loke;
iye, sisandla sami esilulekele
ngaphezu kwazo zoke izizwe.”

16:
Eendledlaneni abantu bembatha iinzilo;
bakhuphukela emaphahleni weenkumba nematatawini,
godu woke umuntu wehla alila.

17:
Nje-ke, yiza neqhinga, wenze isiqunto;
sigubuzesa ngomthunzakho njengobusuku
lokha ilanga nalisefokothweni;
ufihle abahlakazekileko,
ungembuli abaphalali.

18:
Imizi yomHlangulwa itjhiyiwe;
seyingeyemihlambi elala lapho,
kungabi nomuntu oyethusako.

20:
Abasebenza ngeflaksi bazakukakamala;
abafazi abayihlengako
nabayelukako baphaphatheke;

22:
ngombana nakhu okutjhiwo nguSomandla kimi:
“Khamba, ufese ubeke umlindi,
amemezele lokho akubonako;

23:
I-Elamu sele ihlome ngesilanda
namajoni akhwele iinkarana zepi ezibotjhelweko;
iKhiri yembule iinhlangu.

25:
Kuzose kufane:
Okwenzeka ebantwini, kuzakwenzeka nebaphristini
okwenzeka kumakhoboka, kwenzeke nakubanini bawo;
okwenzeka encekukazini, kwenzeke nakumphathikazayo;
okwenzeka kumthengi, kwenzeke nakumthengisi;
okwenzeka kumbolekisi, kwenzeke nakumboleki;
okwenzeka kumatjhonisa, kwenzeke nakobolekako.

26:
Mhlokho abantu bazakuthi:
“Ngambala, uZimethu ula;
samqalelela bona asisindise.
Iye, nguye-ke uSomnini lo esathembela kuye;
yeke asithabeni, sithokoze esindiswenakhe.”

28:
nakungasinjalo akeze kimi azokhosela,
enze ukuthula nami;
iye, kumele enze ukuthula nami.”

30:
kodwana ngizakuhlunguphaza i-Ariyeli,
kube nokulila nokuzila;
iye, idorobheli kimi lizakuba yikehla yomlilo.

Mhlokho iinthulu zizakuzwa amezwi womsongo;
kuthi iimphofu zivuleke amehlo
ekufifiyeleni nebumnyameni bazo.

34:
Nina barhayili nimitha utjani obomileko,
nizakubeletha amawunguwungu;
umphefumulwenu umlilo ozoniqothula.

Mbala, Somnini umugwebethu;
uSomnini umubusethu;
uSomnini uyikosethu;
yena uzasisindisa.

35:
Imilanjana yakwa-Edomu izakuba sikontiri,
iqulwani yakhona ibe sibabuli;
iye, nenarha ibe sikontiri esivuthako.

39:
Kwathi ngisalele lapho bekwasa,
waphohloza woke amathambami njengebhubezi;
iye, ubusuku nemini bewungiqedelela.

41:
Ilizwi larhuwelela lathi:
“Lungiselelani uSomnini indlela erhalawumbeni;
nivule indlela enqophileko yakaZimethu ebhudwini.

Iphazimulo kaSomnini izakwembulwa;
boke abantu bazayibona
ngombana umlomo kaSomnini ukhulumile.”

42:
Iinhlengele zikubonile lokho zesaba
nepelazwe yathuthumela.
Zaphumela etjhatjhalazini, zahlangana;

43:
Umhlanga otshinyekileko akazukuwukhambiselela
nesibani esififiyelako akazukusicima.
Uzakuletha ukunzinza ngokweqiniso;

Uyabona, izinto zaphambilini sezenzekile,
nje-ke ngimemezela izinto ezitja;
nginazisa zona ngaphambi kobana zivumbuke.”

USomnini uzakutjhagala njengengorho,
avuselele itjisakalo njengebutho;
uzakurhuwelela, ahlabe umkhosi wepi;
azibonakalise amuhluli wezitha zakhe.

45:
Omunye uzakuthi, ‘Mina ngingowakaSomnini’;
omunye azibize ngebizo lakaJakopo;
kanti omunye uzazitlola esandleni athi,
‘NgingowakaSomnini’,
uthathe isinanazelo saka-Israyeli.”

Umkhandisimbi usebenza ngesitlabagelo
emalahleni avuthako;
ubumba isiga ngeenondo,
asiqoqode ngeemphanga zakhe.
Naye uyalamba, aphelelwe mamandla;
nangaseli amanzi uyatsirimezeka.

Uzalisa ilizwi lencekwakhe
aphumelelise ihlelo elamenyezelwa ziinthunywa zakhe,
uthi ngeJerusalema, “Izakuhlalwa babantu”;
athi ngamadorobho wakwaJuda, “Azakuvuselelwa;
iye, ngizakwakha butjha ebekubhuruziwe.”

49:
Qala, ngikuhlungile,
kodwana ingasi njengesiliva;
ngakuzizinya eziko lamatshwenyeko.

Azange bome eendaweni ezomileko
lapha uSomnini abahlahla khona;
wabapha amanzi agelezako avela edwaleni;
iye, waphadlhula idwala amanzi agobhoza.’ ”

50:
Ngilalelani nina nhlengele;
yelelani lokhu, nina zizwe ezikude:
USomnini wangibiza
ngaphambi kobana ngibelethwe;
wangithiya ibizo ngisesemanzini.

54:
Emva kokugandelelwa ngomlandu, yasuswa;
akakho noyedwa owanghonghoyila ngokwayehlelako.
Mbala, yajutjwa enarheni yabaphilako;
yalinyazwa ngenca yesiphambeko sabantu bayo.

61:
“Vuka ukhanye wena Jerusalema
ngombana ukukhanya kwakho kuyeza;
iphazimulo kaSomnini idarhile phezu kwakho.

Mbala, isizwe namkha umbuso
ongeze wakulotjha, uzakubhubha;
iye, izizwezi zizakupheliswa nya.

66:
ITjharoni izakuba mrhula weembuzi nezimvu,
umrhoba we-Akori ube yindawo yokuphumula kweenkomo;
iye, kube lilifa labantu bami abangifunako.

67:
Ngambala, uSomnini uzokukhupha isigwebo ngomlilo
nangesabulakhe phezu kwayo yoke inyama;
labo ababulewe nguSomnini bazakuba banengi.

6:
Abaphorofidi bazakuba mumoya;
ilizwi lakaZimu alikho kibo.”
Yeke akuthi abakutjhoko kwenzeke phezu kwabo.

7:
Kodwana abelusi nemihlambabo bazakuza kiyo,
bahlome amatendabo phezu kwayo mazombe;
ngiloyo naloyo adlise isabelo sakhe kiyo.

9:
Ngebanga lokudabuka kwabantu bekhethu,
nami ngidabukile, ngizilile;
ukukakamala kungibambile.

10:
Bayaphoqana begodu abakhulumi iqiniso;
bajayeza amalimabo ukukhuluma amala.
Badurhile,

11:
Kodwana uSomnini unguZimu wamambala;
unguZimu ophilako, iKosi yanini nanini.
Lokha nathukutheleko, iphasi liyadengezela;
izizwe azikwazi ukubhesela ilaka lakhe.

Zililize lakolize, ziziinkohliso;
isikhathi sokugwetjwa kwazo nasifikako,
zizakubhubha.

Nje-ke, Somnini, ngikhalime,
kwaphela kube ngokulunga;
ungangibhubhisi ngetukuthelwakho.

16:
Nabakubuza bathi ‘Alo, sizakuyaphi nje?’ yithi kibo, ‘Nakhu okutjhiwo nguSomnini:
“ ‘Bokufa, abaye ekufeni;
besabula, esabuleni;
bendlala, endlaleni;
nebokuthunjwa, basiwe ekuthunjweni.’ ”

18:
Yewungipholise Somnini, ngizakuphola;
ngisindise, ngizakusinda
ngombana wena uyindumiswami.

26:
nabo boke abantu abayicubevange yakhona;
woke amakhosi wenarha ye-Utsi;
woke amakhosi wenarha yamaFilista, okutjho i-Atjhikheloni, iGaza, i-Ekhironi kanye nemisalela ye-Atjhidodi;

Yizwani isililo sabelusi
nokurhahlawula kwabanini bemihlambi!
USomnini wonakalisa amadlelwabo;

31:
Akakho omela indabakho;
akunasihlahla sokwelapha inceba,
akukho ukupholiswa kwakho.

32:
Ngambala ngemva kokuphambuka kwami,
ngazisola;
ngemva kobana ngilemuke lokho,
ngathwala imikhono ehloko;
ngaba neenhloni, ngakhena,
iye, bengithwele ihlazo lobutjha bami.’

Nakhu okutjhiwo nguSomnini uMninimandlawoke, uZimu wakwa-Israyeli: “Godu bazakusebenzisa amezwi la enarheni yakwaJuda nemadorobheni wakhona lokha nangitjhugulula ubujamo babo:
“ ‘USomnini akubusise, wena buhlalo bokulunga;
iye, wena mbundu ocwengileko!’

51:
Ngetjhada lokuthunjwa kweBhabheli,
inarha izakuthuthumela;
isililo salo sizakuzwakala hlangana nezizwe.”

52:
Ngizokuthumela abeli eBhabheli
kobana bele bebabhubhise inarha yakhona;
bazalithelekela ncazoke ngelanga lehlekelele.

Zililize lakolize, ziziinkohliso;
isikhathi sokugwetjwa kwazo nasifikako,
zizakubhubha.

5:
Jekezela uthabe ndodakazi ye-Edomu;
wena ohlala enarheni ye-Utsi.
Kodwana nakuwe ikapho izakufika;
uzakudakwa, uzihlubulise.

8:
Isikhathi sifikile, ilanga liyatjhidela;
umthengi akangathabi nomthengisi angalili,
ngombana ilaka liphezu komnotho woke wenarha.

“ ‘Ngizalinikela ezandleni zabezizwe njengepango,
kwabakhohlakeleko bephasi libe sihlangulo;
bona-ke bazalisilaphaza.

Ngizokufulathelisa ubuso bami,
ukuze abagongodi basilaphaze indawami eligugu;
iye, abadlelezeli bazayingena bebayisilaphaze.

Kuzakuba yihlekelele phezu kwehlekelele,
amarhemurhemu alandelwe marhemurhemu;
bazasoloko bafuna umbono emphorofidini;
ifundiso iphele emphristini
neenluleko zabadala.

22:
“Rhahlawula, ulile ndodana yomuntu,
ngombana isabula ijamelene nabantu bami;
iye, ijamelene nawo woke amakhosana wakwa-Israyeli.
Anikelelwa esabuleni kanye nabantu bami;
ngalokho thwala imikhono ehloko.

Nami ngizakuwahla izandla,
ngizanelise ngelaka lami;
mina Somnini ngikhulumile.”

27:
Kodwana kwanje iinarha ezimagegana nelwandle
ziyathuthumela ngesikhathi sokuwa kwakho;
iye, iinhlengele zikakamele ngokunyamalala kwakho.”

28:
Amadoda we-Arivadi neRheleki
bekaphezu komthangalakho mazombe;
amaGamadi asemibhotjhongwenakho.
Aphanyeka iinlanda zawo
emithangaleni mazombe;
aphelelisa ubuhle bakho.

Boke abahlala magegana nelwandle
bayakhuza ngawe;
iinhluthu zamakhosabo ziyabophana ngevalo
nobuso bawo bunyamile;

32:
Zoke iinyoni zomkayi
zenza iindlwana zazo emaphakghenawo;
iimbandana zommango zoke
zazalela ngaphasi kwamatjhwabawo;
iye, nangaphasi komthunzawo
kwahlala zoke izizwe ezikulu.

33:
Ngizokwenya inarha ngamanzi wesidumbu
avinyilika eengazini zakho bekube seentabeni;
imilanjana izakuzala okuncinca kuwe.

3:
USomnini uthi:
“Mhlokho uzangibiza uthi ‘babakwami’;
ungasathi ‘Bhalami’.

Iphasi liphendule ikoroyi,
isidiribe namafutha we-oliva;
zona-ke zizakuphendula uJizriyela.

5:
Badlile, kodwana asoze basutha;
bangwadlile, kodwana asoze bande.
ngebanga lokobana abaphristi batjhiye uSomnini,

6:
Ukuzikhukhumeza kuka-Israyeli kujamelene naye.
Ama-Israyeli ngitjho no-Efrayimu bararejwa zizono zabo;
uJuda unyandanye nabo:

7:
ngombana ngilulukela ukwethembeka,
ingasi umhlabelo;
nokwazi ngoZimu kuneminikelo yokutjhiswa.”

8:
Ikosabo iyabathabela ngokuyibeka kwabo
ngekohlakalo;
nababusi bayo bayathokoza ngamangabo.

Kuzakuthi basabaleka njalo,
ngiphose igolanedami phezu kwabo;
ngizabadosela phasi njengeenyoni zomkayi;
ngibabambe njengothiya iwoma lamazuba.

9:
U-Israyeli urhiribidelwe;
sese afana namawunguwungu
hlangana nezizwe ezinye

10:
Abantwaba abazukuhlala enarheni kaSomnini;
U-Efrayimu uzakubuyela eGibhide
nanyana adle ukudla okuzilwako e-Asiriya.

Idumo laka-Efrayimu linyelele,
lemuke njengenyoni;
kungabikhona ukubeletha, ukuzithwala nokubamba.

13:
USomnini umangalela uJuda;
uzokuhlunguphaza uJakopo ukuya ngeendlela zakhe,
ambethe ngeentonga zakhe.

Nasesemanzi uJakopo wabamba isithende
sakamfowabo;
nasele aqinile wabindana noZimu.

UJakopo wabalekela enarheni ye-Aramu,
u-Israyeli wasebenza nzima nazakuthatha umfazi;
wamlobola ngokwelusa izimvu.

U-Efrayimu uqhukuluze uSomnini okusilingako;
iKosakhe-ke izamthwesa umlandu
beyimhlawulise ngokuyirhubutjha kwakhe.

14:
Ukubhubha kwakho, wena Israyeli,
kungebanga lami;
mina msizakho.

15:
I-Asiriya angeze yasisiza;
asisazokuthembela eenjomaneni zepi;
angeze besisatjho sithi ‘zimethu’
entweni esiyenze ngezandla zethu
ngombana kuwe wedwa nentandani
ifunyana isirhawu.”

ngizakufana nombethe ku-Israyeli;
yena athuthumbe njengamakhwa.
anabise imirabhakhe ekuzikeni,
adzimelele njengeLibhanoni;

2:
Isizwe esinamandla nesinganakubalwa
sisahlele inarha yakwethu;
sinamazinyo nemihlathi enjengeyeengwenyama.

Sirhayile isidiribe sakwethu;
sahlikiliza nemithi yakwethu yamakhiwani.
Sebule amaqolo,
sawaphuphura sawatjhwamadela;
satjhiya iimpande zimhlophe twa.

Ummango urhayiliwe;
amasimu omile;
amabele ahlikiliziwe;
iwayini elitja litjhile
namafutha we-oliva akasekho.

Bekani ilanga lokuzila;
memezelani umhlangano okhethekileko.
Bizelani endlini kaSomnini uZimenu,
abaphathi boke nezakhamuzi;
nilile kuSomnini.

Maye mhlokho!
Ngambala ilanga lakaSomnini libandamele;
liza ngokubhubhisa okukhulu kukaSomandla.

Maye ukubongolela kweenkomo!
Imihlambi ihlakazekile ngombana ayinamadlelo;
ngitjho nemihlambi yezimvu isesonweni.

3:
USomnini uthi:
“Vuthelani ipalapala eZiyoni;
nihlabe umkhosi entatjaneni yami ecwengileko.”
Akuthi zoke izakhamuzi zihlengezele
ngombana ilanga lakaSomnini liyeza;
iye, selitjhidele khulu.

Vuthelani ipalapala eZiyoni;
bekani ilanga lokuzila,
nimemezele umhlangano okhethekileko.

Ningesabi nina mbandana zommango,
ngombana amadlelo emrhuleni azokuba lihlaza;
nemithi ithele iinthelo zayo;
imithi yamakhiwani nesidiribe kuhlome kuphuke.

“Kuzakuthi emuva kwalokho
ngithululele uMoyami kibo boke abantu.
Amadodanenu namadodakazenu azakuphorofida;
abadala benu babhudange amabhudango;
abatjha benu babone imibono.

4:
Zaphosa ifumbe ngabantu bami,
zathenga ukulala neengwadla ngabesana;
zathenga umrhamulo wewayini ngabentazana.

2:
U-Amosi wathi:
“USomnini ubhodla aseZiyoni;
uzwakalisa ilizwi lakhe aseJerusalema.
Amasiso wabelusi ayatjhwaba;
kuthi isiqongolo seKarameli somelele.”

7:
Nisela iwayini ngomjeka,
nizimonyonge ngamafutha kanokutjho;
kodwana anikuzileli ukurhayilwa kwakaJosefa.

Yeke nizakuba hlangana nebokuthoma
abazakuya ekuthunjweni;
ukukhomba kwenu ngophakathi kuzakuphela.

10:
USomninni uSomandla uMninimandlawoke,
othi nathinta iphasi lincibilike,
kuthi boke abahlala kilo batlhuwe;
inarha yoke iphuphume njengeNayili,
ibohle njengomlambo weGibhide;

2:
“Lokha nakufika amasela ngendlini
nabagongodi ebusuku,
bathatha abakufunako kwaphela;
kodwana wena uzakuhlangulwa.
Lokha abavuni nabavuna esidiribeni
batjhiya ambalwa;
kodwana abantu bakwa-Esewu bazakukhuthuzwa koke;

Boke abakhozi bakho bazakukghurumejela emkhawulweni;
onokuthula nabo bakurhwale bebakubinde;
onghwatha nabo bazakubekela isifu
esihlakeni sakho.”
Godu uSomnini wathi ngomphorofidi ku-Edomu:
“Akukasi kuye!

3:
“Ningaphikeleli ukuphorofida.
Aninalungelo lokuphorofida njalo,
isiphoqweso asizukusehlela;

ngombana uSomnini uthembise indlu kaJakopo;
uMoya wakaSomnini uyabekezela;
uSomnini akenzi izinto ezinjalo.”
Awa, amezwami amenzela okuhle olungileko.

5:
Kuzakufika isikhathi lapha
intaba yethempeli lakaSomnini
izakunzinza khona esiqongolweni seentaba;
izakuphakanyiswa yengamele imibundu yoke;
yeke izizwe zizayirhuluphela.

7:
Akhese nilalele okutjhiwo nguSomnini. Uthe kimi:
“Sikima, umangalele iintaba;
imibundu ayizwe ubufakazi bakho.

8:
Iinkhulu zakhona zamukela umlandu ngokukhongozela;
abagwebi bakhupha iingwebo ngokufunjathiswa;
ngitjho nomgwebi omkhulu akanabulilelo ugweba umathanda.

Ngebanga lokobana ngitjhaphele uSomnini,
ngizakugugubala ngaphasi kobukhali bakhe,
bekube kumhla angikhupha emlandwini;
mhlana abuyisa ilungelo lami.
Uzangikhuphela ekukhanyeni;
ngizakubona ukulunga kwakhe.

Abantwaba bazakurhurhuba njengenyoka;
bakhase njengeembandana ehlabathini.
Bazakuphuma batatazela erholweni labo;
bahlengezele phambi kwakho Somnini Zimethu,
bazakwesaba ngebanga lakho.

3:
INiniva idlelezelwe, yahlangulwa;
yasala ilirubhi!
Iinhliziyo zadana,
amadolo ayathuthumela,
imizimba yoke iyahlengezela;
boke ubuso buyaphaphatheka.

4:
Akunamuntu ongelapha amancebakho;
awuzukusinda ngeduma lakho.
Woke umuntu ozwa iindaba zakho,
uwahla izandla ngokuwa kwakho.
Ngombana akunamuntu ongazange khewumhlunguphaze;
ngobukhohlakali bakho obungapheliko.

2:
Iinjomani zabo zigijima ukudlula izingwe,
zidlhaduma ukudlula iimpisi ebusuku.
Abakhweli bakhona beza bafuthekile;
abakhweli bakhona bavela kude.
Batheleka njengedlanga nalibhudungela ukudla kwalo;

boke beze ngokurhayila.
Amabutho wakhona atheleka njengommoya werhalawumbeni;
abuthelela iimbotjhwa njengetjhwabatjhwaba.

Banyaza amakhosi,
bahlekisa ngababusi.
Bahleka woke amadorobho anemithangala;
badindela ihlabathi emithangaleni yakhona;
bawasahlele bawathumbe.

3:
Ngambala, umnono uyamkhohlisa ozikhukhumezako
begodu angeze aphumelela;
umarhamaru njengethuna,
urhiribidela njengokufa;
ubuthelela izizwe zoke kuye,
athumbe boke abantu.’

4:
UZimu uvele ngeTemana;
Ocwengileko uvele ngentabeni iParana.
Sela
Iphazimulwakhe igubuzesa amazulu;
ubuphaziphazi bakhe buzele iphasi.

Ukumanyazela kwakhe kunjengokuphuma kwelanga;
imisubela iphazima esandleni sakhe.
Lapha kufihlakele khona amandlakhe.

Iintaba nazikubonako ziyathuthumela;
kuvela iinrhurhula zamanzi;
kubhodla amanzi ekuzikeni,
athwele amagobhoza.

Nanyana umuthi wamakhiwani ungatlhurhi,
kutlhogeka namadiribe esidiribeni;
nanyana isivuno se-oliva singahlomi
kutlhogeka nokudla emasimini;
nanyana kunganazimvu ngesibayeni
kutlhogeka neenkomo ngesibayeni;

3:
Isifunda seligu sizakuba miraga,
indawo yabelusi;
siphenduke iimbaya zezimvu.

Izakuba yinarha yemisalela yekumba yakwaJuda;
izimvu zabo zidle lapho.
Ebusuku bazakulala ngemarubhini we-Atjhikheloni.
USomnini uZimabo uzabatjheja;
atjhugulule ubujamo babo.

4:
Alilaleli muntu, alivumi ukusolwa;
alithembeli kuSomnini,
alitjhideli hlanu koZimalo.

Nanyana uSomnini olungileko angaphakathi kwedorobheli;
kunganabumbi abenzako,
ngamasa angahluleki,
abonakalisa ukulunga kwakhe imihla ngemihla;
kodwana khonapho iinkhohlakali abe azinanhloni.

10:
Kodwana uSomandla uzayiqubula,
abhubhise iinthayamanzi zayo elwandle;
iqothulwe mlilo.

2:
uHezekiya wabeletha uManase;
uManase wabeletha u-Amosi,
u-Amosi wabeletha uJosiya;

Ngemva kokuthunjelwa eBhabheli,
uKoniya wabeletha uTjhaltiyeli;
uTjhaltiyeli wabeletha uZerubhabheli.

UZerubhabheli wabeletha u-Abiyudi;
u-Abiyudi wabeletha u-Eliyakhimu;
u-Eliyakhimu wabeletha u-Azori;

u-Azori wabeletha uTsadoki;
uTsadoki wabeletha u-Arhimu;
u-Arhimu wabeletha u-Eliyudi;

u-Eliyudi wabeletha u-Elazara;
u-Elazara wabeletha uMathani;
uMathani wabeletha uJakopo,

Nakhu okutlolwe encwadini yomphorofidi u-Isaya:
“Ngizokuthumela isithunywa sami ngaphambi kwakho,
esizokulungisa indlelakho;

3:
Ngalokho ihliziywami yenamile;
ngihlokoma ngamandla
ngombana umzimbami ulondekile.

14:
ukuzalisile kithi, thina nzukulwana zabo ngokuvusa uJesu, njengombana kutloliwe eRhubeni lesibili bona,
“ ‘Wena uyiNdodanami;
namhlanje ngiyakuvuselela.’

29:
‘Khamba uye esizwenesi ufese uthi:
“ ‘Nizokuzwa kodwana ningazwisisi;
nizokubona kodwana ningatjheji.

4:
Imiphimbo yabo imaliba avulekileko;
basebenzisa amalimabo ukukhohlisa.
Isihlungu seenyoka singaphasi kweembhena zabo.

11:
Kodwana ngiyabuza-ke: Abakezwa na? Mbala bezwile ngombana,
“Amaphimbo wabo azwakele ephasini loke;
namezwabo emaphethelweni womhlaba.”

12:
Nje-ke woke u-Israyeli uzokusindiswa njengombana kutloliwe kwathiwa:
“EZiyoni kuzakuvela uMsindisi;
afike aqede ukungalungi kuJakopo.

2:
Uyihloko yomzimba, okulibandla;
usithomo, izibulo labavuswa ekufeni,
ukuze abe ngewokuthoma kikho koke.

Zona izintwezo zizakubhubha,
kodwana wena ujamile.
Iye, zoke zizakuphela njengengubo;

11:
Ngesizathweso uKrestu nakafika ephasinapha wathi:
“Imihlabelo neminikelo yeenthoro awuyithokozeli;
kodwana ungilungisele umzimba;

Olungileko wami uzakuphila ngokukholwa;
kodwana nangabe uhlehlela emuva;
umphefumulwami awuzukuthokoza ngaye.”

8:
Iinkulungwana ezilitjhumi nambili ekorweni yakaJuda;
iinkulungwana ezilitjhumi nambili ekorweni yakaRubeni;
iinkulungwana ezilitjhumi nambili ekorweni yakaGadi;

iinkulungwana ezilitjhumi nambili ekorweni yaka-Atjheri;
iinkulungwana ezilitjhumi nambili ekorweni yakaNafitali;
iinkulungwana ezilitjhumi nambili ekorweni yakaManase;

Iinkulungwana ezilitjhumi nambili ekorweni yakaSimiyoni;
iinkulungwana ezilitjhumi nambili ekorweni yakaLevi;
iinkulungwana ezilitjhumi nambili ekorweni yaka-Isakari;

iinkulungwana ezilitjhumi nambili ekorweni yakaZebuloni;
iinkulungwana ezilitjhumi nambili ekorweni yakaJosefa;
iinkulungwana ezilitjhumi nambili ekorweni yakaBhenjamini.

19:
Liphatheni njengombana nalo lenzile;
libuyiseleleni ngokubuyelelweko
kilokho elikwenzileko;
niqarhe ngokubuyelelweko
ekatjheni elayiqarhako.

Angekhe kusakhanya isibani kuwe;
itjhada lokusina kwedwendwe
angekhe lisezwakala kuwe;
abarhwebi bakho bebaziinkhulu zephasi,
begodu ngobuloyi bakho
walutha zoke izizwe.
